#<font color=""></font>
I couldn’t find the words to describe my excitement.[l] This entire observatory is like a gigantic glass dome, leaving you with a complete and full scale picture of the starlit horizon. [l]The room wraps around this huge telescope in the centre. [l][r][r]Not the kind an amateur would use, of course.[l] We’re talking about those super big cylindrical scopes even professionals struggle to work with. [p]

