Yo! [l]I’m Nicola! [l]I’m the main astrophysicist of this place. [l]Nice to meet you! [p]

[image storage=default/EuphieSprites/euphie_normal_smile.png layer=2 x=35 y=458 visible=true time=0 width=181 height=217]
#<font face="earthorbiter"><font color="#ff8080">Euphie</font>
Oh, nice to meet you too. [l]I’m Euphémia, but you can call me Euphie! [l]I’m an astrophysicist as well, but I’m also an astronaut. [p]
[freeimage layer=2]

[image storage=default/UI_Elements/stellar_ui_chat2big.png layer=1 x=35 y=458 visible=true time=0 width=181 height=217]
#<font face="EarthOrbiter"<font color="#85e085">Nicola</font>
[chara_mod name="Nicola" storage="/chara/5/nicola_open.png" time=200 cross=false]
Woah, multi tasking![l] You must be quite the prodigy, especially since you seem so young! [p]
[freeimage layer=1]

[current layer="message1"]
[layopt layer="message0" visible=false]
[layopt layer="message1" visible=true]
#<font color=""></font>
Isn’t she young as well...? [p]

[current layer="message0"]
[layopt layer="message1" visible=false]
[layopt layer="message0" visible=true]
[image storage=default/UI_Elements/stellar_ui_chat2big.png layer=1 x=35 y=458 visible=true time=0 width=181 height=217]
#<font face="EarthOrbiter"<font color="#85e085">Nicola</font>
[chara_mod name="Nicola" storage="/chara/5/nicola_happy.png" time=200 cross=false]
Well Klaus, aren’t you lucky to have two perfect looking girls on the ship now? [p]
