[image storage=default/UI_Elements/stellar_ui_chat2big.png layer=1 x=35 y=458 visible=true time=0 width=181 height=217]
#<font face="earthorbiter"><font color="#cc66ff">Klaus</font>
Well, at least Euphie here doesn’t seem to be as out of the ordinary as you or the others. [l]So, yeah, I’m glad we finally have someone well composed here. [p]
[chara_mod name="Klaus" storage="/chara/2/klaus_thinking2.png" time=200 cross=false]
I’d grown quite tired of imagining holding decent conversations with anyone normal here. [p]

#<font face="EarthOrbiter"<font color="#85e085">Nicola</font>
[chara_mod name="Nicola" storage="/chara/5/nicola_frown.png" time=200 cross=false]
That just sounds sad now, Klaus... [l]
[chara_mod name="Nicola" storage="/chara/5/nicola_neutral2.png" time=200 cross=false]
I mean sure, Joshua and I aren’t the example of well composed, but what about Alexei? [l]
[chara_mod name="Nicola" storage="/chara/5/nicola_smile.png" time=200 cross=false]
That guy’s our polar opposite! [p]

#<font face="earthorbiter"><font color="#cc66ff">Klaus</font>
[chara_mod name="Klaus" storage="/chara/2/klaus_sweat.png" time=200 cross=false]
That guy’s as cold hearted and vicious as a snake.[l] You know more than I that nobody here is able to hold a conversation with him that lasts for more than a minute. [p]

#<font face="EarthOrbiter"<font color="#85e085">Nicola</font>
[chara_mod name="Nicola" storage="/chara/5/nicola.png" time=200 cross=false]
Well, you got a point there. [l]But I’m sure once he opens up to you, he could become a real sweetheart. [p]

#<font face="earthorbiter"><font color="#cc66ff">Klaus</font>
[chara_mod name="Klaus" storage="/chara/2/klaus_closed.png" time=200 cross=false]
I want him to open up a little, not tell us everything about himself. [p]
[chara_mod name="Klaus" storage="/chara/2/klaus.png" time=200 cross=false]
Well... [l]That’s all the staff, Euphémia. [l]As you can see, we’re quite lacking in personnel, so it’s great to have you here with us. [p]
[chara_mod name="Klaus" storage="/chara/2/klaus_closed.png" time=200 cross=false]
You’re going to be some much needed help.[l] Especially since our entire group is quite obnoxious... [p]

[chara_mod name="Nicola" storage="/chara/5/nicola_agressive.png" time=200 cross=false]
[chara_move  name="Nicola"  anim="true"  time="300"  effect="easeInQuad"  wait="true"  left="410"  top="0"  width="495"  height="720"  ]
[chara_mod name="Nicola" storage="/chara/5/nicola_leaning_pouting.png" time=200 cross=false]
#<font face="EarthOrbiter"<font color="#85e085">Nicola</font>
Who’re you calling calling obnoxious, you old dummy! [p]

[chara_mod name="Klaus" storage="/chara/2/klaus_pathetic.png" time=200 cross=false]
#<font face="earthorbiter"><font color="#cc66ff">Klaus</font>
Speak for yourself, you...[l] You little... [l]Plankton... [p]

#<font face="EarthOrbiter"<font color="#85e085">Nicola</font>
[chara_mod name="Nicola" storage="/chara/5/nicola_shocked.png" time=200 cross=false]
[chara_move  name="Nicola"  anim="true"  time="500"  effect="easeInQuad"  wait="false"  left="390"  top="0"  width="495"  height="720"  ]
W- [p]
[chara_mod name="Nicola" storage="/chara/5/nicola_question.png" time=200 cross=false]
Plankton?! [l]Did you just call me a- [p]
[chara_mod name="Nicola" storage="/chara/5/nicola_happy.png" time=200 cross=false]
[chara_move  name="Nicola"  anim="true"  time="500"  effect="easeInBounce"  wait="false"  left="143"  top="30"  width="495"  height="720"  ]
PffrrrahAHAHAH! [p]
[freeimage layer=1]

