That wasn’t really funny, but Nicola’s laugh was extremely contagious, and I accidentally started laughing too. [l]I could see Klaus was very flustered. [l]Honestly, I would be too, after saying something so...[l] Childish? [l]Peculiar? [l]I can’t even find a fitting term. [p]

