We get off... [p]

[layopt layer="message1" visible=false]
[bg storage=Backgrounds/bg06_cafeteria.png method=crossfade time=1000 wait=false]

[layopt layer="message1" visible=true]
...and we enter the cafeteria. [p]

[chara_show  name="Joshua"  time="1000"  wait="false"  storage="chara/3/joshua.png"  width="495"  height="720"  left="200"  top="0"  reflect="false"  ]
[chara_show  name="Alexei"  time="1000"  wait="false"  storage="chara/4/alex.png"  width="495"  height="720"  left="770"  top="0"  reflect="false"  ]

Joshua and Alexei are already there.[l] They seemed  to have already started eating. [l][r][r]They were both sitting at different tables.[l] But they still managed to keep conversations going, despite their distance.[l] Joshua was probably trying to just break the awkward silence. [p]

[current layer="message0"]
[layopt layer="message0" visible=true]
[layopt layer="message1" visible=false]
[image storage=default/UI_Elements/stellar_ui_chat2big.png layer=1 x=35 y=458 visible=true time=0 width=181 height=217]

#<font face="EarthOrbiter"<font color="#ffcc33">Joshua</font>
[chara_mod name="Joshua" storage="/chara/3/joshua_smile.png"  time=200 cross=false]
Man, space food just can’t beat fresh stuff. [p]
#<font face="EarthOrbiter"<font color="#66ccff">Alexeï</font>
[chara_mod name="Alexei" storage="/chara/4/alex_closed.png" time=200 cross=false]
I don’t see the difference. [p]

#<font face="EarthOrbiter"<font color="#ffcc33">Joshua</font>
[chara_mod name="Joshua" storage="/chara/3/joshua.png"  time=200 cross=false]
Really now? [l]Can’t you feel how artificial it tastes? [p]
#<font face="EarthOrbiter"<font color="#66ccff">Alexeï</font>
[chara_mod name="Alexei" storage="/chara/4/alex_lookout.png" time=200 cross=false]
The point is for them to be easy to eat. [l]Not to be some kind of premium meal.[l] If you’re here for a steak, just go back down to earth. [p]
#<font face="EarthOrbiter"<font color="#ffcc33">Joshua</font>
[chara_mod name="Joshua" storage="/chara/3/joshua_thinking.png"  time=200 cross=false]
What did you eat down there, then? [p]
#<font color=""></font>
[chara_mod name="Alexei" storage="/chara/4/alex_thinking_look.png" time=200 cross=false]

[freeimage layer=1]
[current layer="message1"]
[layopt layer="message1" visible=true]
[layopt layer="message0" visible=false]

Alexei went silent for a minute. [p]

[current layer="message0"]
[layopt layer="message0" visible=true]
[layopt layer="message1" visible=false]
[image storage=default/UI_Elements/stellar_ui_chat2big.png layer=1 x=35 y=458 visible=true time=0 width=181 height=217]

#<font face="EarthOrbiter"<font color="#66ccff">Alexeï</font>
[chara_mod name="Alexei" storage="/chara/4/alex_thinking_closedeyes.png" time=200 cross=false]
I... [p]
#<font face="EarthOrbiter"<font color="#ffcc33">Joshua</font>
[chara_mod name="Joshua" storage="/chara/3/joshua_perplexed.png"  time=200 cross=false]
Couldn’t hear ya. [p]
#<font face="EarthOrbiter"<font color="#66ccff">Alexeï</font>
[chara_mod name="Alexei" storage="/chara/4/alex_thinking.png" time=200 cross=false]
I can’t cook. [p]
#<font face="EarthOrbiter"<font color="#ffcc33">Joshua</font>
[chara_mod name="Joshua" storage="/chara/3/joshua_sleep_smile.png" time=200 cross=false]
Ahah! [l]Well no shame in that. [l]But what do you eat, then? [l]Surely you must go eat out, or someone cooks for you. [p]
#<font face="EarthOrbiter"<font color="#66ccff">Alexeï</font>
[chara_mod name="Alexei" storage="/chara/4/alex_thinking_look.png" time=200 cross=false]
I just eat space food. [p]
#<font face="EarthOrbiter"<font color="#ffcc33">Joshua</font>
[chara_mod name="Joshua" storage="/chara/3/joshua_scared.png" time=200 cross=false]
What?! [p]
#<font face="EarthOrbiter"<font color="#66ccff">Alexeï</font>
[chara_mod name="Alexei" storage="/chara/4/alex.png" time=200 cross=false]
Just like right here. [p]
#<font face="EarthOrbiter"<font color="#ffcc33">Joshua</font>
[chara_mod name="Joshua" storage="/chara/3/joshua_surprised.png" time=200 cross=false]
But... [l]Why? [p]
#<font face="EarthOrbiter"<font color="#66ccff">Alexeï</font>
[chara_mod name="Alexei" storage="/chara/4/alex.png" time=200 cross=false]
It’s...[l] Accessible. [p]
#<font face="EarthOrbiter"<font color="#ffcc33">Joshua</font>
[chara_mod name="Joshua" storage="/chara/3/joshua_angry.png" time=200 cross=false]
Accessible. [p]
#<font face="EarthOrbiter"<font color="#66ccff">Alexeï</font>
[chara_mod name="Alexei" storage="/chara/4/alex_thinking.png" time=200 cross=false]
Easy to eat. [p]

#<font face="EarthOrbiter"<font color="#ffcc33">Joshua</font>
[chara_mod name="Joshua" storage="/chara/3/joshua_neutral.png" time=200 cross=false]
Right. [p]

#<font face="EarthOrbiter"<font color="#66ccff">Alexeï</font>
[chara_mod name="Alexei" storage="/chara/4/alex_thinking_look.png" time=200 cross=false]
And vegan. [p]

#<font face="EarthOrbiter"<font color="#ffcc33">Joshua</font>
[chara_mod name="Joshua" storage="/chara/3/joshua_perplexed.png" time=200 cross=false]
True. [p]

#<font face="EarthOrbiter"<font color="#66ccff">Alexeï</font>
[chara_mod name="Alexei" storage="/chara/4/alex_thinking_shocked.png" time=200 cross=false]
...And pricey. [p]

#<font face="EarthOrbiter"<font color="#ffcc33">Joshua</font>
[chara_mod name="Joshua" storage="/chara/3/joshua_surprised.png" time=200 cross=false]
Of course it's freaking pricey![l] Out of all the things you could eat down on earth, why would you go for that? [p]
[chara_mod name="Joshua" storage="/chara/3/joshua_scream_sweat.png" time=200 cross=false]
There’s so many kinds of instantly cooked things, easy to prepare stuff, even for anyone who's never touched a pan or an oven! [p]

#<font face="EarthOrbiter"<font color="#66ccff">Alexeï</font>
[chara_mod name="Alexei" storage="/chara/4/alex_thinking_embarassed.png" time=200 cross=false]
...Just shut up. [p]

#<font face="EarthOrbiter"<font color="#ffcc33">Joshua</font>
[chara_mod name="Joshua" storage="/chara/3/joshua_sleep_sigh.png" time=200 cross=false]
Christ... [p]
