Hey.[l] Hope you didn’t just take some of our portions again. [p]

#<font face="EarthOrbiter"<font color="#ffcc33">Joshua</font>
[chara_mod name="Joshua" storage="/chara/3/joshua_smile.png" time=200 cross=false]
Nahhh, I would never! [l]Especially since lil’ Euphie is here with us now! [p]

[freeimage layer=1]
