[layopt layer="message0" visible=false]
[layopt layer="message1" visible=true]

#<font color=""></font>
I pick my food with Nicola and Klaus, and we decide to sit down as well. [l]
Klaus and Nicola chose to sit with Joshua, so I decided to sit in front of Alexei. [l]
As I and everyone else start to unpack our lunch, I could witness some drones and small robots cleaning the room. [p]

[current layer="message0"]
[layopt layer="message1" visible=false]
[layopt layer="message0" visible=true]
[image storage=default/UI_Elements/stellar_ui_chat2big.png layer=1 x=35 y=458 visible=true time=0 width=181 height=217]

