Didn’t know that there were robots taking care of the place! [p]
[freeimage layer=2]

#<font face="EarthOrbiter"<font color="#66ccff">Alexeï</font>
[chara_mod name="Alexei" storage="/chara/4/alex_lookout.png" time=200 cross=false]
They only take care of unimportant chores. [l]It’s not like tomorrow, they'll be smart enough to replace us entirely. [p]

[freeimage layer=1]
