[layopt layer="message0" visible=false]
[layopt layer="message1" visible=true]

#<font color=""></font>
Surprisingly enough, Alexeï spoke up. [p]

[current layer="message0"]
[layopt layer="message1" visible=false]
[layopt layer="message0" visible=true]
[image storage=default/UI_Elements/stellar_ui_chat2big.png layer=1 x=35 y=458 visible=true time=0 width=181 height=217]

#<font face="EarthOrbiter"<font color="#ffcc33">Joshua</font>
[chara_mod name="Joshua" storage="/chara/3/joshua.png" time=200 cross=false]
They’re taking care of the busy work, though.[l] If they didn’t, we’d have way less time on our hands. [p]
Considering the size of this place, I’m glad they clean and repair everything up by themselves. [p]
[chara_mod name="Joshua" storage="/chara/3/joshua_sleep_smile.png" time=200 cross=false]
Even though I’d never leave my life in the hands of some piles of junk. [l]I can only trust my muscles! [p]

[chara_mod name="Nicola" storage="/chara/5/nicola_agressive.png" time=200 cross=false]
#<font face="EarthOrbiter"<font color="#85e085">Nicola</font>
What muscles... [p]

#<font face="EarthOrbiter"<font color="#ffcc33">Joshua</font>
[chara_mod name="Joshua" storage="/chara/3/joshua_angry.png" time=200 cross=false wait=true]
[chara_move  name="Joshua"  anim="true"  time="500"  effect="easeInQuad"  wait="true"  left="318"  top="0"  width="495"  height="720"  ]
[chara_mod name="Joshua" storage="/chara/3/joshua_perplexed.png" time=200 cross=false]
Hey! [p]

#<font face="EarthOrbiter"<font color="#85e085">Nicola</font>
[chara_mod name="Nicola" storage="/chara/5/nicola_question.png" time=200 cross=false]
But you’re right, they do give us more time for our actual job and side activities.[l] I wish we could have a bit more people here, however. [p]
[chara_mod name="Nicola" storage="/chara/5/nicola_staredown.png" time=200 cross=false]
Such a gigantic station for such a short handed staff... [l]It’s kind of a waste. [p]

[freeimage layer=1]
[current layer="message1"]
[layopt layer="message0" visible=false]
[layopt layer="message1" visible=true]

#<font color=""></font>
She says as she dives her fork into her mouth, all proud like. [p]

[_tb_end_tyrano_code]

[tb_start_tyrano_code]
[current layer="message0"]
[layopt layer="message1" visible=false]
[layopt layer="message0" visible=true]
[image storage=default/UI_Elements/stellar_ui_chat2big.png layer=1 x=35 y=458 visible=true time=0 width=181 height=217]

#<font face="earthorbiter"><font color="#cc66ff">Klaus</font>
[chara_move  name="Klaus"  anim="true"  time="300"  effect="easeInQuad"  wait="true"  left="-41"  top="0"  width="495"  height="720"  ]
Speaking of which... [p]
[freeimage layer=1]

[current layer="message1"]
[layopt layer="message0" visible=false]
[layopt layer="message1" visible=true]

#<font color=""></font>
Klaus put down his plastic cutlery, as if to get our attention. [p]

[current layer="message0"]
[layopt layer="message1" visible=false]
[layopt layer="message0" visible=true]
[image storage=default/UI_Elements/stellar_ui_chat2big.png layer=1 x=35 y=458 visible=true time=0 width=181 height=217]

[chara_move  name="Klaus"  anim="true"  time="300"  effect="easeInQuad"  wait="false"  left="-41"  top="0"  width="495"  height="720"  ]
#<font face="earthorbiter"><font color="#cc66ff">Klaus</font>
You’ve already all been acquintenced with Euphémia already, so I’ll keep it short. [l]As you can see, Euphie, only between five to seven people are pretty much necessary to take care of the entire place. [p]
Everything else is pretty much automated, thanks to these drones we just talked about. [l]Usually, the station requires two to three cosmonauts, two astrophysicists and one or two engineers. [p]
[chara_mod name="Klaus" storage="/chara/2/klaus_closed.png" time=200 cross=false]
We used to be six in total, but unfortunately, three had to retire.[l] We were left with only me as an astronaut, Joshua as an engineer, and Nicola as an astrophysicist. [p]
Hence why we were left short handed, still in need of at least one more astronaut and astrophysicist, and eventually another engineer, to take care of our base. [p]
[chara_mod name="Nicola" storage="/chara/5/nicola_side_pointing.png" time=200 cross=false]
#<font face="EarthOrbiter"<font color="#85e085">Nicola</font>
And so, we hired this little prodigy over here. [p]

[freeimage layer=1]
[current layer="message1"]
[layopt layer="message0" visible=false]
[layopt layer="message1" visible=true]

#<font color=""></font>
Nicola aimed her fingers at Alexei, who didn't blink an eye and continued to eat, as if ignoring the entire discussion. [p]

[current layer="message0"]
[layopt layer="message1" visible=false]
[layopt layer="message0" visible=true]
[image storage=default/UI_Elements/stellar_ui_chat2big.png layer=1 x=35 y=458 visible=true time=0 width=181 height=217]

#<font face="earthorbiter"><font color="#cc66ff">Klaus</font>
[chara_mod name="Klaus" storage="/chara/2/klaus.png" time=200 cross=false]
Though Alexeï doesn’t have the most eccentric personality, he’s quite good in almost every aspect. [p]
He knows his way around the most complex forms of technology and machines, and that makes him a brillant asset. [p]
[chara_mod name="Klaus" storage="/chara/2/klaus_closed.png" time=200 cross=false]
He is also very knowledgeable in geoscience, and is getting his way around becoming a prodigy astronaut. [p]

[image storage=default/EuphieSprites/euphie_thinking_normal.png layer=2 x=35 y=458 visible=true time=0 width=181 height=217]
#<font face="earthorbiter"><font color="#ff8080">Euphie</font>
So he’s only recently joined you? [p]
[freeimage layer=2]

#<font face="EarthOrbiter"<font color="#ffcc33">Joshua</font>
[chara_mod name="Joshua" storage="/chara/3/joshua.png"  time=200 cross=false]
Yeah. [l]Been around for half a year, and I still feel like I’ve never actually seen him more than a few days of my lifetime, since he’s close to a shut-in. [p]

#<font face="earthorbiter"><font color="#cc66ff">Klaus</font>
[chara_mod name="Klaus" storage="/chara/2/klaus_pathetic.png" time=200 cross=false]
Maybe if you didn’t sleep on the job, that’d be a different story, Joshua. [p]

#<font face="EarthOrbiter"<font color="#ffcc33">Joshua</font>
[chara_mod name="Joshua" storage="/chara/3/joshua_scared_flip.png" time=200 cross=false]
[chara_move  name="Joshua"  anim="true"  time="300"  effect="easeInQuad"  wait="true"  left="320"  top="10"  width="495"  height="720"  ]
Erk... [p]
[freeimage layer=1]

[current layer="message1"]
[layopt layer="message0" visible=false]
[layopt layer="message1" visible=true]

#<font color=""></font>
Klaus glared at Joshua with a disgusted expression. [l]Sensing the hostility in his glare, Joshua quickly turned around, with a pale face. [p]

[current layer="message0"]
[layopt layer="message1" visible=false]
[layopt layer="message0" visible=true]
[image storage=default/UI_Elements/stellar_ui_chat2big.png layer=1 x=35 y=458 visible=true time=0 width=181 height=217]

#<font face="EarthOrbiter"<font color="#ffcc33">Joshua</font>
[chara_move  name="Joshua"  anim="true"  time="300"  effect="easeInQuad"  wait="true"  left="270"  top="0"  width="495"  height="720"  ]
[chara_mod name="Joshua" storage="/chara/3/joshua_thinking.png" time=200 cross=false]
We thought that with Alexeï around, we wouldn’t need any more help, but... [p]

#<font face="EarthOrbiter"<font color="#85e085">Nicola</font>
[chara_mod name="Nicola" storage="/chara/5/nicola_neutral.png" time=200 cross=false]
Four people to run an entire space station without any form of leadership...[l] Yikes. [p]

#<font face="EarthOrbiter"<font color="#ffcc33">Joshua</font>
[chara_mod name="Joshua" storage="/chara/3/joshua.png" time=200 cross=false]
[chara_move  name="Joshua"  anim="true"  time="500"  effect="easeInQuad"  wait="true"  left="200"  top="0"  width="495"  height="720"  ]
Eh, I quite liked this freedom! [l]But Klaus has been such a tyrant since the depart of the three senior staff, it’s safe to assume he’s been some kind of hidden leader all along... [p]

#<font face="earthorbiter"><font color="#cc66ff">Klaus</font>
[chara_mod name="Klaus" storage="/chara/2/klaus_smile.png" time=200 cross=false]
I’m only harsh on you because you are so lazy, Joshua. [p]

#<font face="EarthOrbiter"<font color="#ffcc33">Joshua</font>
[chara_mod name="Joshua" storage="/chara/3/joshua_flustured.png" time=200 cross=false]
D-Don’t say that with such a wry smile on your face, you’re creeping me out! [p]

#<font face="earthorbiter"><font color="#cc66ff">Klaus</font>
[chara_mod name="Nicola" storage="/chara/5/nicola_question.png" time=200 cross=false]
[chara_mod name="Klaus" storage="/chara/2/klaus.png" time=200 cross=false]
Whatever the case, we needed someone else. [l]Some kind of leader, competent in many domains. [p]
And that’s why we asked someone as promising as you to fortify our group, both in work and in mind. [p]

[image storage=default/EuphieSprites/euphie_normal_flustered.png layer=2 x=35 y=458 visible=true time=0 width=181 height=217]
#<font face="earthorbiter"><font color="#ff8080">Euphie</font>
But you’re much more experienced than I am... [l]Why go to such a risk? [p]
[freeimage layer=2]

#<font face="earthorbiter"><font color="#cc66ff">Klaus</font>
[chara_mod name="Klaus" storage="/chara/2/klaus.png" time=200 cross=false]
Perhaps, but new blood will help bring us closer, so we can become more effective during our experiments and discoveries. [l]Actually, we’re not the ones who chose you directly. [p]
[chara_mod name="Klaus" storage="/chara/2/klaus_angry2.png" time=200 cross=false]
The General Administration of Astronomy and Space chose you themselves. [l]To be perfectly honest with you, [l]I think they saw in you a means to fill in the two missing staff positions with only one person. [p]
[freeimage layer=1]

[current layer="message1"]
[layopt layer="message0" visible=false]
[layopt layer="message1" visible=true]

#<font color=""></font>
Hmph. [l]I don’t know why the entrance exams are so inaccessible and difficult if they’re gonna end up putting anyone on the job in the end. [l]
But I’m not gonna complain, this is my time to shine. [p]

[current layer="message0"]
[layopt layer="message1" visible=false]
[layopt layer="message0" visible=true]

[image storage=default/UI_Elements/stellar_ui_chat2big.png layer=1 x=35 y=458 visible=true time=0 width=181 height=217]
#<font face="earthorbiter"><font color="#cc66ff">Klaus</font>
[chara_mod name="Klaus" storage="/chara/2/klaus_smile.png" time=200 cross=false]
But don’t worry, I’ll help you. [l]Actually, WE’ll all help you to achieve that goal. [l]Am I right? [p]

#<font face="EarthOrbiter"<font color="#ffcc33">Joshua</font>
[chara_mod name="Joshua" storage="/chara/3/joshua_smile.png" time=200 cross=false]
Count me in. [p]

#<font face="EarthOrbiter"<font color="#85e085">Nicola</font>
[chara_mod name="Nicola" storage="/chara/5/nicola_smile.png" time=200 cross=false]
Yeah, me too! [p]

#<font face="EarthOrbiter"<font color="#66ccff">Alexeï</font>
[chara_mod name="Alexei" storage="/chara/4/alex_lookout.png" time=200 cross=false]
Sure. [p]
#<font face="earthorbiter"><font color="#cc66ff">Klaus</font>
[chara_mod name="Klaus" storage="/chara/2/klaus.png" time=200 cross=false]
Now, let’s finish our meal. [l]Once we’re done, let’s get down to business and head to the command deck. [l]Euphémia has yet to see it. [p]

#<font face="EarthOrbiter"<font color="#85e085">Nicola</font>
[chara_mod name="Nicola" storage="/chara/5/nicola_leaning.png" time=200 cross=false]
But we’ve all had time to finish while you were speaking... [p]
#<font face="earthorbiter"><font color="#cc66ff">Klaus</font>
[chara_mod name="Klaus" storage="/chara/2/klaus_sweat.png" time=200 cross=false]
...[l]Oh. [p]
